{"4040170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Help me Cats", "steam_appid": 4040170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4764280], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Borrow a cat’s help when you’re scared!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Help me Cats&quot; is a 3D horror adventure game where you advance while repelling evil spirits—and sometimes, get help from cats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you step into the mansion your pet cat wandered into, it turns out to be another world swarming with countless evil spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge or repel their attacks as you chase after your beloved pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if progressing becomes too difficult, the ghost cats you met before entering the mansion might stand up against the evil spirits in your place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/1d25e059cd228ef56d9c2b2da90abcb5.avif?t=1785911006\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/b8939b7e669760e14cdc0cdb5bf006f0.avif?t=1785911006\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the otherworld, various evil spirits will come to attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your actions from different options, dodge enemy strikes, or launch your own attacks to drive them away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful—if your mental strength drops to zero, you too will become a spirit and be swallowed by the otherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/c43d335682aabefa620293e0108fdf20.avif?t=1785911006\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/2321bcce62b4a7fde76ee1ffceef03bc.avif?t=1785911006\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/eebfda81ed8d6e7fd66424695d9bb581.avif?t=1785911006\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an evil spirit is right in front of you, hold down “E” to use the item “Cat’s Hand”, and a ghost cat will come to your aid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/b1f2dfce562588f51d14f98a86c72243.avif?t=1785911006\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/7e0cb4815e6ad8fdb9d480bd1dd8730d.avif?t=1785911006\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/4e01bbd5d0543eeabdf3b9fa90f92069.avif?t=1785911006\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/cc16d0d8aa57a42898dcf25d25f9ef4b.avif?t=1785911006\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/5ddd4c3b95a9f7441ef531f676ce05e8.avif?t=1785911006\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These ghost cats are reliable allies that can drive away any evil spirit, but since the “Cat’s Hand” can only be used three times in total across all stages, you’ll need to carefully decide when to use it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Play Time]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One playthrough: approx. 15 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Endings Completion: 60–90 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% Completion (including collecting all Cat's Paw uses): 120–150 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Number of Endings]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3+α</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Regarding Streaming and Video Uploads]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are welcome to stream or upload videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a company or an individual, you may play, stream, or upload videos without needing to contact us for permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also fine if you earn revenue from streaming or uploading videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please include the game’s title (“Help me Cats” only is fine) in the title of your video or stream, and include the URL of this store page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Note: The bonus content (SP) in the ending collection unlocked after obtaining the Bad End, Normal End, and True End is prohibited from being posted online; however, streaming or uploading videos is allowed if the relevant sections are hidden.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Borrow a cat’s help when you’re scared!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Help me Cats&quot; is a 3D horror adventure game where you advance while repelling evil spirits—and sometimes, get help from cats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you step into the mansion your pet cat wandered into, it turns out to be another world swarming with countless evil spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge or repel their attacks as you chase after your beloved pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if progressing becomes too difficult, the ghost cats you met before entering the mansion might stand up against the evil spirits in your place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/1d25e059cd228ef56d9c2b2da90abcb5.avif?t=1785911006\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/b8939b7e669760e14cdc0cdb5bf006f0.avif?t=1785911006\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the otherworld, various evil spirits will come to attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your actions from different options, dodge enemy strikes, or launch your own attacks to drive them away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful—if your mental strength drops to zero, you too will become a spirit and be swallowed by the otherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/c43d335682aabefa620293e0108fdf20.avif?t=1785911006\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/2321bcce62b4a7fde76ee1ffceef03bc.avif?t=1785911006\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040170/extras/eebfda81ed8d6e7fd66424695d9bb581.av